-- title:
--   Original UBV true stopped infinite-activity physical source eventual signed martingale budget
-- statement:
--   On the exact stopped original infinite-activity Levy physical grid, exhibit integrable mean-zero compensated martingale mesh M_j, converging in L1 and a.e. to integrable Mc. The full original discounted source is eventually at most M_j+epsilon on all sample paths, using the nonpositive finite-generator HJB sum and a vanishing Euler discretisation bias. Unlike an exact finite-grid centring claim, this source is sound in presence of frozen left-endpoint generator bias and requires no pathwise generator Riemann convergence.

